  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Better Understanding of Indicators to Address Labor Trafficking in Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will help the Peruvian government and other labor stakeholders build their capacity to prevent, detect and eliminate forced labor and labor trafficking from workplaces in Peru. By bringing together the Ministry of Labor, regional and local governments, law enforcement officials and the judiciary branch, the project will encourage better enforcement through consultation and consensus-building.</narrative>
  </description>
